  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Catalog source",
      "items": [
        "Region and commune choices come from GET /api/locations, not hardcoded lists (location_routes.py:25)",
        "Keys are official CUT codes; communes live in Comunas with a region FK (models.py:43-70)",
        "The catalog endpoint is public and sets Cache-Control max-age=3600 (location_routes.py:15)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Server-side validation",
      "items": [
        "commune_code is required for non-client roles in the UI (auth-panel.tsx:393) and in the schema (account_schemas.py:80-81)",
        "The backend checks the code against Comunas and returns a Spanish 422 on loc commune_code (account_routes.py:54-66)",
        "The browser never writes profiles directly; provisioning goes through FastAPI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Stored reference",
      "items": [
        "Perfil.Codigo_Comuna is a nullable FK to Comunas with ondelete RESTRICT (models.py:152)",
        "Legacy free-text Ubicacion stays for display and backward compatibility (migration 20261010_0002)",
        "Conductor carries the same Codigo_Comuna reference for independent drivers (models.py:236)"
      ]
    }
  ]
